From 6f7c005790f6a99c03c9b14943cedf58e38f0c65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:58:24 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(boards): lanes for a board of several workflows

A project board whose Type rules use several workflows shows four columns that
each hold several statuses: To do, In progress, Awaiting approval (every step a
person approves, locked heading) and Done. Cards name their real status, and
every card shows its days in column (from one day, red from five). Dropping on a
lane picks the lane's first status the card's own workflow (its Type rule's)
allows. A board of one workflow keeps one column per step.
Reference: Jira board column mapping, days in column.

Patch-Id: board-lanes
